{"parse":{"title":"Lunar Vigil","pageid":429509,"revid":2121740,"redirects":[],"text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Lunar Vigil</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/2/28/Talent_Lunar_Vigil.png/revision/latest?cb=20260115185702\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Talent Lunar Vigil\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/2/28/Talent_Lunar_Vigil.png/revision/latest?cb=20260115185702\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/2/28/Talent_Lunar_Vigil.png/revision/latest?cb=20260115185702 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/2/28/Talent_Lunar_Vigil.png/revision/latest?cb=20260115185702 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Talent Lunar Vigil\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\" data-image-key=\"Talent_Lunar_Vigil.png\" data-image-name=\"Talent Lunar Vigil.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"character\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Char­ac­ter</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Columbina\" title=\"Columbina\">Columbina</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Talent Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Utility_Passive\" title=\"Utility Passive\">Utility Passive</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Category</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Passive_Talent\" title=\"Passive Talent\">Passive</a></div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDetails\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"info\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">If one of your party members is <a href=\"/wiki/Fallen_Character\" title=\"Fallen Character\">incapacitated</a> while in the <a href=\"/wiki/Nod-Krai\" title=\"Nod-Krai\">Nod-Krai</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Frost_Moon\" title=\"Frost Moon\">Frost Moon</a> regions, Columbina will revive this character. The amount of HP the character will have upon revival is based on Columbina's <a href=\"/wiki/Friendship_Level\" title=\"Friendship Level\">Friendship Level</a>. This effect can occur once every 100s. This effect does not trigger in Domains, Trounce Domains, or the Spiral Abyss.<br />Additionally, Columbina appears to have a special affinity for certain animals who are influenced by <a href=\"/wiki/Kuuvahki\" title=\"Kuuvahki\">kuuvahki</a>...</div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"utility1\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><b>Utility</b><ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Healing\" title=\"Healing\">Healing</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Revival\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Revival\">Revival</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Triggers_on_Character_Death\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Triggers on Character Death\">Triggers on Character Death</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Wildlife\" title=\"Wildlife\">Wildlife</a></li></ul></div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<b>Lunar Vigil</b> is <a href=\"/wiki/Columbina\" title=\"Columbina\">Columbina</a>'s <a href=\"/wiki/Utility_Passive\" title=\"Utility Passive\">Utility Passive</a>.\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Gameplay_Notes\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gameplay Notes</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Other_Languages\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Other Languages</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Change_History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Change History</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Navigation\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Navigation</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gameplay_Notes\">Gameplay Notes</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fgenshin-impact.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FLunar_Vigil%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Columbina must be in the active party and alive for this passive's effects to work. This applies to both the revival effect and the <a href=\"/wiki/Wildlife\" title=\"Wildlife\">wildlife</a>-related effects.</li>\n<li>If Columbina is the active character and is incapacitated while this passive is not on cooldown, she will revive herself.</li>\n<li>If a party member is incapacitated while this passive is on cooldown or unavailable, the revival will not activate even after this passive is available again.</li>\n<li>Like with <a href=\"/wiki/Lauma\" title=\"Lauma\">Lauma</a>'s <a href=\"/wiki/Prayers_for_the_Forest\" title=\"Prayers for the Forest\">utility passive</a>, certain wildlife will behave differently if Columbina is in the party. This only applies in Nod-Krai, and will not work on the same creatures in other <a href=\"/wiki/Region\" title=\"Region\">regions</a>.\n<ul><li>Some creatures will have special interactions. A glowing <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Frostmoon Scions\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Frostmoon Scions.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Frostmoon_Scions.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/e/e9/Icon_Dialogue_Frostmoon_Scions.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20250911080920\" /></span></span> symbol will briefly appear above them when approached.\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Blunthorn_Rhino\" title=\"Blunthorn Rhino\">Blunthorn Rhino</a> - These mine and retrieve nearby <a href=\"/wiki/Rainbowdrop_Crystal\" title=\"Rainbowdrop Crystal\">Rainbowdrop Crystals</a>.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Chic_Badger\" title=\"Chic Badger\">Chic Badger</a> - These dig up <a href=\"/wiki/Fowl\" title=\"Fowl\">Fowl</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Raw_Meat\" title=\"Raw Meat\">Raw Meat</a> (amount varies).</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Puffin\" title=\"Puffin\">Puffin</a> - These follow the party around.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Rimehorn_Deer\" title=\"Rimehorn Deer\">Rimehorn Deer</a> - These heal the party and fully fill their <a href=\"/wiki/Energy\" title=\"Energy\">Energy</a> meters.</li></ul></li>\n<li>Wildlife in the \"<a href=\"/wiki/Wildlife#Other\" title=\"Wildlife\">Other</a>\" category will not <a href=\"/wiki/Startle\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Startle\">startle</a> when approached.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Pale-Furred_Wolf\" title=\"Pale-Furred Wolf\">Pale-Furred Wolves</a> will not attack when approached. However, they will do so if the player enters combat or stays near them for more than a few minutes.</li>\n<li>Unlocks exclusive dialogue with certain <a href=\"/wiki/Animal_NPCs\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Animal NPCs\">animal NPCs</a>, such as <a href=\"/wiki/Pavlov\" title=\"Pavlov\">Pavlov</a> at the <a href=\"/wiki/Speranza#Lucky_Spin!\" title=\"Speranza\">Lucky Spin</a> minigame, the <a href=\"/wiki/Finches\" class=\"mw-disambig\" title=\"Finches\">finch</a> beside <a href=\"/wiki/Richeza\" title=\"Richeza\">Richeza</a> at the <a href=\"/wiki/Vesnici_Proleca_Greenhouse\" title=\"Vesnici Proleca Greenhouse\">Vesnici Proleca Greenhouse</a>, and the guard animals near <a href=\"/wiki/Lyylikki\" title=\"Lyylikki\">Lyylikki</a>.</li></ul></li>\n<li>The following <a href=\"/wiki/Talent\" title=\"Talent\">Talents</a> are similar to this talent:\n<ul><li>Other Wildlife:\n<ul><li><span class=\"item talent\"><span class=\"item-image\"><span class=\"hidden\" data-size=\"20\" style=\"height:20px;width:20px\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Prayers_for_the_Forest\" title=\"Prayers for the Forest\"><img alt=\"Prayers for the Forest\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Talent Prayers for the Forest.png\" data-image-key=\"Talent_Prayers_for_the_Forest.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/1/1d/Talent_Prayers_for_the_Forest.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20250910024350\" /></a></span></span><span class=\"mobile-only\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Prayers_for_the_Forest\" title=\"Prayers for the Forest\"><img alt=\"Prayers for the Forest\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Talent Prayers for the Forest.png\" data-image-key=\"Talent_Prayers_for_the_Forest.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/1/1d/Talent_Prayers_for_the_Forest.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/30?cb=20250910024350\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"item-text\"> <a href=\"/wiki/Prayers_for_the_Forest\" title=\"Prayers for the Forest\">Prayers for the Forest</a></span></span> (<a href=\"/wiki/Lauma\" title=\"Lauma\">Lauma</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"item talent\"><span class=\"item-image\"><span class=\"hidden\" data-size=\"20\" style=\"height:20px;width:20px\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Tailing_on_Tiptoes\" title=\"Tailing on Tiptoes\"><img alt=\"Tailing on Tiptoes\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Talent Tailing on Tiptoes.png\" data-image-key=\"Talent_Tailing_on_Tiptoes.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/8/89/Talent_Tailing_on_Tiptoes.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20230118020529\" /></a></span></span><span class=\"mobile-only\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Tailing_on_Tiptoes\" title=\"Tailing on Tiptoes\"><img alt=\"Tailing on Tiptoes\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Talent Tailing on Tiptoes.png\" data-image-key=\"Talent_Tailing_on_Tiptoes.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/8/89/Talent_Tailing_on_Tiptoes.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/30?cb=20230118020529\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"item-text\"> <a href=\"/wiki/Tailing_on_Tiptoes\" title=\"Tailing on Tiptoes\">Tailing on Tiptoes</a></span></span> (<a href=\"/wiki/Yaoyao\" title=\"Yaoyao\">Yaoyao</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"item talent\"><span class=\"item-image\"><span class=\"hidden\" data-size=\"20\" style=\"height:20px;width:20px\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Thought_and_Intent,_Like_Silken_Scent\" title=\"Thought and Intent, Like Silken Scent\"><img alt=\"Thought and Intent, Like Silken Scent\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Talent Thought and Intent, Like Silken Scent.png\" data-image-key=\"Talent_Thought_and_Intent%2C_Like_Silken_Scent.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/1/11/Talent_Thought_and_Intent%2C_Like_Silken_Scent.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20250121102239\" /></a></span></span><span class=\"mobile-only\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Thought_and_Intent,_Like_Silken_Scent\" title=\"Thought and Intent, Like Silken Scent\"><img alt=\"Thought and Intent, Like Silken Scent\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Talent Thought and Intent, Like Silken Scent.png\" data-image-key=\"Talent_Thought_and_Intent%2C_Like_Silken_Scent.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/1/11/Talent_Thought_and_Intent%2C_Like_Silken_Scent.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/30?cb=20250121102239\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"item-text\"> <a href=\"/wiki/Thought_and_Intent,_Like_Silken_Scent\" title=\"Thought and Intent, Like Silken Scent\">Thought and Intent, Like Silken Scent</a></span></span> (<a href=\"/wiki/Lan_Yan\" title=\"Lan Yan\">Lan Yan</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"item talent\"><span class=\"item-image\"><span class=\"hidden\" data-size=\"20\" style=\"height:20px;width:20px\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Yoohoo_Art:_Silencer%27s_Secret\" title=\"Yoohoo Art: Silencer&#39;s Secret\"><img alt=\"Yoohoo Art: Silencer&#39;s Secret\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Talent Yoohoo Art Silencer&#39;s Secret.png\" data-image-key=\"Talent_Yoohoo_Art_Silencer%27s_Secret.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/b/bc/Talent_Yoohoo_Art_Silencer%27s_Secret.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20210810120112\" /></a></span></span><span class=\"mobile-only\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Yoohoo_Art:_Silencer%27s_Secret\" title=\"Yoohoo Art: Silencer&#39;s Secret\"><img alt=\"Yoohoo Art: Silencer&#39;s Secret\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Talent Yoohoo Art Silencer&#39;s Secret.png\" data-image-key=\"Talent_Yoohoo_Art_Silencer%27s_Secret.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/b/bc/Talent_Yoohoo_Art_Silencer%27s_Secret.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/30?cb=20210810120112\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"item-text\"> <a href=\"/wiki/Yoohoo_Art:_Silencer%27s_Secret\" title=\"Yoohoo Art: Silencer&#39;s Secret\">Yoohoo Art: Silencer's Secret</a></span></span> (<a href=\"/wiki/Sayu\" title=\"Sayu\">Sayu</a>)</li></ul></li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Other_Languages\">Other Languages</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fgenshin-impact.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FLunar_Vigil%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"article-table\">\n<tbody><tr><th>Language</th><th>Official Name</th><th>Literal Meaning</th></tr><tr><td><b>English</b></td><td>Lunar Vigil</td><td>&#8212;</td></tr><tr><td><b>Chinese<br /><small>(Simplified)</small></b></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hans\">月的守望</span><br /><small><i><span lang=\"zh-rm\">Yuè de Shǒuwàng</span></i></small></td><td rowspan=\"2\">The Moon's Vigil</td></tr><tr><td><b>Chinese<br /><small>(Traditional)</small></b></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">月的守望</span><br /><small><i><span lang=\"zh-rm\">Yuè de Shǒuwàng</span></i></small></td></tr><tr><td><b>Japanese</b></td><td><span lang=\"ja\">月の守護</span><br /><small><i>Tsuki no Shugo</i></small></td><td>Protection of the Moon</td></tr><tr><td><b>Korean</b></td><td><span lang=\"ko\">달의</span> <span lang=\"ko\">가호</span><br /><small><i>Dar-ui Gaho</i></small></td><td>Protection of the Moon</td></tr><tr><td><b>Spanish</b></td><td>Custodia de la luna</td><td>Guarding of the Moon</td></tr><tr><td><b>French</b></td><td>Veill<span lang=\"fr\">é</span>e lunaire</td><td>Lunar Vigil</td></tr><tr><td><b>Russian</b></td><td><span lang=\"ru\">Бдение</span> <span lang=\"ru\">луны</span><br /><small><i>Bdeniye luny</i></small></td><td>Moon Vigil</td></tr><tr><td><b>Thai</b></td><td>Lunar Vigil</td><td>&#8212;</td></tr><tr><td><b>Vietnamese</b></td><td><span lang=\"vi\">Cảnh Giác Của Mặt Trăng</span></td><td>Vigil of the Moon</td></tr><tr><td><b>German</b></td><td>Mondwache</td><td>Moon Vigil</td></tr><tr><td><b>Indonesian</b></td><td>Lunar Vigil</td><td>&#8212;</td></tr><tr><td><b>Portuguese</b></td><td>Vig<span lang=\"pt\">í</span>lia Lunar</td><td>Lunar Vigil</td></tr><tr><td><b>Turkish</b></td><td>Ay N<span lang=\"tr\">ö</span>beti</td><td>Moon Watch</td></tr><tr><td><b>Italian</b></td><td>Veglia lunare</td><td>Lunar Vigil</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Change_History\">Change History</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fgenshin-impact.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FLunar_Vigil%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"change-history\"><div class=\"change-history-header\"><div>Released in <b><a href=\"/wiki/Version/Luna_IV\" title=\"Version/Luna IV\">Version \"Luna IV\"</a></b></div><div>[<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Lunar_Vigil/Change_History?action=edit\">Edit History</a>]</div></div><div class=\"change-history-content standard-border\"><a href=\"/wiki/Version_%22Luna_VIII%22\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Version &quot;Luna VIII&quot;\">Version \"Luna VIII\"</a>\n<ul><li>Updates to talent description:\n<ul><li><span class=\"text-old\"><b>Old</b></span>:  If one of your party members is incapacitated while in the Nod-Krai <span class=\"bg-highlight\">region</span>, Columbina will revive this character. The amount of HP the character will have upon revival is based on Columbina's Friendship Level. This effect can occur once every 100s. This effect does not trigger in Domains, Trounce Domains, or the Spiral Abyss.<br />Additionally, Columbina appears to have a special affinity for certain animals who are influenced by kuuvahki...</li>\n<li><span class=\"text-new\"><b>New</b></span>:  If one of your party members is incapacitated while in the Nod-Krai <span class=\"bg-highlight\">or Frost Moon regions</span>, Columbina will revive this character. The amount of HP the character will have upon revival is based on Columbina's Friendship Level. This effect can occur once every 100s. This effect does not trigger in Domains, Trounce Domains, or the Spiral Abyss.<br />Additionally, Columbina appears to have a special affinity for certain animals who are influenced by kuuvahki...</li></ul></li></ul>\n<hr />\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Version_%22Luna_IV%22\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Version &quot;Luna IV&quot;\">Version \"Luna IV\"</a>\n</p>\n<ul><li>Lunar Vigil was released.</li></ul></div></div><div style=\"clear:both; margin:0; padding:0;\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Navigation\">Navigation</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fgenshin-impact.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FLunar_Vigil%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"navbox-border navbox\" style=\"border-spacing:0;;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding:2px;\"><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"nowraplinks mw-collapsible navbox-inner\" style=\"border-spacing:0;background:transparent;color:inherit;;\"><tbody><tr><th style=\";\" colspan=\"2\" class=\"navbox-title\"><div class=\"hidden\" style=\"float:left;width:6em;text-align:left\">&#160;</div><span class=\"\" style=\"font-size:110%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Talent\" title=\"Talent\">Talents</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Constellation\" title=\"Constellation\">Constellations</a> of <a href=\"/wiki/Columbina\" title=\"Columbina\">Columbina</a></span></th></tr><tr style=\"height:2px;\"><td></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"width:100%;padding:0px;text-align: center;;;\" class=\"navbox-list navbox-odd\"><div style=\"padding:0em 0.25em\">\n<table width=\"100%\" st